  (text "SCHEMATIC PASS 1 - CONTROL BOARD INTERFACE FROM MASTERTEMP 125 REV C FIGURE 24/25"
    (at 25.4 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fe49883d-82bd-4fa6-b1b3-c25fb74e706b")
  )
  (text "NO GAS VALVE DRIVE OUTPUT ON THIS SHEET."
    (at 25.4 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8bb6349d-24d5-469a-b827-8dceff77562a")
  )
  (text "J2 operating-control order is manual-assumed from Rev. C Figure 24: VAL, TH, IND, GND, 24VAC, 24VAC, FS.\nVAL and IND are sense-only. TH is switched only through K1 and K2 normally-open contacts in series."
    (at 25.4 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "b71738fa-01f3-4b16-9d2f-fdb0cd4f17d0")
  )
  (text "J2 OPERATING CONTROL TERMINALS\n1 VAL_SENSE_MONITOR_ONLY\n2 TH_HEAT_REQUEST_OUT\n3 IND_SENSE\n4 ICM_GND_REF\n5 ICM_24VAC_SOURCE\n6 FIREMAN_24VAC\n7 FIREMAN_SWITCH_RETURN"
    (at 25.4 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "5c077367-8a77-4a1a-9902-869d32b773ad")
  )
  (text "ICM_24VAC_SOURCE -> K1_COM -> K1_NO -> K2_COM -> K2_NO -> TH_HEAT_REQUEST_OUT.\nVAL and GAS are diagnostic monitor inputs only; this board must never source or drive the gas valve."
    (at 95.25 101.6 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "763a66e7-4d32-4ccf-b190-db8884480963")
  )
  (text "Relay coil gating remains to be captured with drivers/flyback after supervisor and safety sheets are updated.\nK1 and K2 coil nets are named here for later connection to low-side MOSFETs and +5V_RELAY."
    (at 25.4 145.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "a62b74ab-86c2-4f39-ae30-066eafad5d52")
  )
  (text "ICM terminal reference from manual Figure 24/25: S1/240, S1/120, L1, L2, S2, TH, IND, VAL, GND.\nThis project preserves the OEM ICM and does not replace ignition, blower, HSI, flame proving, or gas-valve sequencing."
    (at 25.4 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "862dc7e0-99c0-4dcd-8452-e7ffda368d2a")
  )
